      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Query layer** \u2013 every query is timed and logged. **Live** = typed in the terminal (`mart_sql shell`), shown within 10 s. **Pipeline** = the 6 dashboard queries run after every load in two versions: **raw** (joins the big fact tables) and **summary** (reads a small pre-aggregated table). Speed-up = raw time \u00f7 summary time."
      }
    },
